330-34H.YAG, 3-ele., 34' boom, heavy-duty elements
10.100 10.125 10.150 MHz
3 elements, inches
           4.684    2.250    2.000    1.000    0.875 
  0.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   15.000   53.750 
212.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   15.000   26.625 
402.500   12.000  108.000  120.000   15.000   14.500 

The mounting bracket is a 6" x 24" x 0.5" plate,
represented by the 4.684" equivalent OD pipe, 12"
on each side of boom. These elements are designed
for 120 mph winds.

Front-to-rear ratio is better than 20 dB across band,
and SWR is less than 1.1:1 across band, with a mid-
band free-space gain of 8.2 dBi.

